{"id":"af40856855b155a1","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-measure6-atom.md","title":"ZFC Measure6 Atom","display":"df-zfc-measure6-atom — ZFC Measure6 Atom","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure6-atom","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure6-atom"],"display":"df-zfc-measure6-atom — ZFC Measure6 Atom","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-measure-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure6-atom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure6-atom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure6-atom — ZFC Measure6 Atom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,A,B\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span> (measure-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6Atom}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6Atom}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure6\\text{-}atom} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6Atom}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land A\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\mu(A)&gt;0\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(B\\subseteq A\\to(\\mu(B)=0\\lor\\mu(A\\setminus B)=0)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure6\\text{-}atom} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6Atom}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land A\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\mu(A)&gt;0\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(B\\subseteq A\\to(\\mu(B)=0\\lor\\mu(A\\setminus B)=0)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is a positive measurable set every measurable subset of which is null or conull in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The conull clause uses <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(A\\setminus B)=0\">\\(\\mu(A\\setminus B)=0\\)</span> rather than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(B)=\\mu(A)\">\\(\\mu(B)=\\mu(A)\\)</span>, since equality of two infinite measures would not force the complement to be null.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S$ (measure-space predicate, see [[58-df-measure-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6Atom}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure6\\text{-}atom} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6Atom}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land A\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\mu(A)>0\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(B\\subseteq A\\to(\\mu(B)=0\\lor\\mu(A\\setminus B)=0)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(A\\setminus B)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(B)=\\mu(A)","display":false}],"bytes":1099,"backlinks":[{"id":"03d0b034f577792b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2618","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-measure6-atom.md|58-df-zfc-measure6-atom]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","83a15c7e9b3817dc"]}